js/mechanics.js

This is the most important file.

Ultimate lifecycle

Make the lifecycle generic.

startUlt(who) should essentially:

* select the owner
* set ultOn = true
* set ultT = ULT_TIME
* set ultMax = ULT_TIME
* set the meter appropriately
* optionally create the existing generic ultBurst(...)
* do nothing car-specific

There must be no switch/if chain based on the car’s power.

tickUlt(who, dt) should:

* decrement the ultimate timer
* update the displayed fraction
* call endUlt() when the timer expires
* perform no per-car power update

endUlt(who) should:

* turn the ultimate off
* reset the timer/meter state
* perform no power-specific cleanup
* cause no rematerialization collision
* not need to inspect which car was using it

Delete or make unreachable the Bolt extension behavior.

Second presses while an ultimate is already active should not trigger any special action.

